<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n109777" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὕφαιμος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>,
			(<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">αἷμα</span>) <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>suffused with blood, blood-shot,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Hp.
				<u>Aph.</u>
				5.23
			</span></i>; of the nails, <i><span class="en">
				Orib.
				<u>Syn.</u>
				7.18
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑγρασία</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Sor.
					1.19
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ῥοῦς</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					2.43
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οἱ βραχίονες καὶ οἱ καρποὶ τῶν χειρῶν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					D.
					47.59
				</span></i>
			; esp. of the eyes, <i><span class="en">
				S.E.
				<u>P.</u>
				1.44
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Gal.
				18(2).301
			</span></i>. <i><span class="en">
				Philostr.
				<u>Gym.</u>
				25
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Philostr.Jun.
				<u>Im.</u>
				15
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">βλέφαρα ὕ.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Arist.
					<u>Phgn.</u>
					807b29
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὕφαιμον βλέπειν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Men.
					<u>Epit.</u>
					479
				</span></i>
			, <i><span class="en">
				Ael.
				<u>NA</u>
				3.21
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ῥίζα ὑ. τὴν χρόαν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Dsc.
					4.23
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b> of
			complexion or temperament, <i>sanguine,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Hp.
				<u>Epid.</u>
				3.14
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὕ. ἵππος</span>”
				<i>hot-blooded,</i>
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pl.
					<u>Phdr.</u>
					253e
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">θερμὸς καὶ ὕ.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Arist.
					<u>Phgn.</u>
					806b4
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				807b32
			</span></i>.</div>
